SUMMARY:Weave\, Repair\, Connect
LOCATION:Mass MoCA\, 1040 Mass MoCA Way\, North Adams\, MA 01247
DESCRIPTION:Textile Repair Salon\nDip your toes into the world of textiles 
 during MASS MoCA’s Textile Repair Salon! Join regional practitioners Jen
 a Duncan and Elsa Cousins from Swanson’s Fabrics Stash House and MASS Mo
 CA museum educators for a casual evening of textile repair\, embroidery\, 
 and small-scale weaving.\nhttps://massmoca.org/event/textile-salon-weave-r
 epair-connect/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
