SUMMARY:Machine Dazzle: Changes
LOCATION:Mass MoCA\, 1040 Mass MoCA Way\, North Adams\, MA 01247
DESCRIPTION:The Costume Design for Taylor Mac’s A 24-Decade History of Po
 pular Music\nMachine Dazzle has been creating extraordinary costumes for o
 ver 30 years. As an artist\, costume designer\, set designer\, and perform
 ance artist\, he has presented his genre-defying work at venues ranging fr
 om Broadway to the runway\, wowing audiences from Joe’s Pub to the Museu
 m of Arts and Design in New York. As the nation marks 250 years of America
 ’s history\, MASS MoCA will showcase wearable sculptural looks by the ar
 tist that examine the 24 decades since the founding of the United States i
 n 1776.\nhttps://massmoca.org/event/machine-dazzle-changes-the-costume-des
 ign-for-taylor-macs-a-24-decade-history-of-popular-music/\nFrom Pushpin We
 stern Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://massmoca.org/event/machine-dazzle-changes-the-costume-design-fo
 r-taylor-macs-a-24-decade-history-of-popular-music/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:946a26fdcc3c23968a69189f3271747f87a88b47@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261128T153847Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270109
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270110
SUMMARY:The Oath
LOCATION:Mass MoCA\, 1040 Mass MoCA Way\, North Adams\, MA 01247
DESCRIPTION:through Jun 30\nSince the beginning of time — in community\, 
 clan\, congregation\, and club — humans have developed systems\, both ut
 opian and dystopian\, for moving together in unison in large groups. The O
 ath\, a film based on Annie-B Parson’s stage choreography\, explores hum
 anity’s dance of vernacular and poetic group actions. Set in a vivid uni
 verse of color\, the work spans time\, from the primeval age and into the 
 future\, and features seventeen women and femmes moving as one for purpose
  and for pleasure\, to gather\, to bond\, to intimidate\, to believe\, to 
 fight\, to promise – to dance.\nhttps://massmoca.org/event/annie-b-parso
 n-and-alla-kovgan-big-dance-theater-the-oath/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: 
 https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://massmoca.org/event/annie-b-parson-and-alla-kovgan-big-dance-the
 ater-the-oath/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:b994f44c52b0b7f20b49ec7d03d1695fbdcb8071@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261128T153847Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270118
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270119
SUMMARY:Nick Meyer
LOCATION:Mass MoCA\, 1040 Mass MoCA Way\, North Adams\, MA 01247
DESCRIPTION:through Jun 30\nNick Meyer lives and works in Western Massachus
 etts. Taking a documentary-adjacent approach\, his photographs explore per
 manence and mutability\, finding beauty in the patina of decay and the wor
 n-away by time. Photographed in Western Massachusetts\, his imagery is ine
 xtricably tied to this place and instantly recognizable to anyone who has 
 spent time here.\nhttps://massmoca.org/event/nick-meyer-good-bones/\nFrom 
 Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://massmoca.org/event/nick-meyer-good-bones/
END:VEVENT
