SUMMARY:On the Queer Songbook:
LOCATION:Mass MoCA\, 1040 Mass MoCA Way\, North Adams\, MA 01247
DESCRIPTION:Taylor Mac and Matt Ray\n“Music solves 99% of the problems in
  the world. We hope to nudge readers\, listeners\, movers\, singers\, and 
 music makers into an openhearted prayer (or spell) of ecstatic frenzy.” 
 — Taylor Mac Renegade theater artists Taylor Mac\, Matt Ray\, and Machin
 e Dazzle’s four-hour rock opera\, Bark of Millions\, is an electrifying 
 collision of performance\, live music\, and drag spectacle celebrating que
 erness\, with the fierce elation of a pride parade.\nhttps://massmoca.org/
 event/on-the-queer-songbook-taylor-mac-and-matt-ray/\nFrom Pushpin Western
  Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://massmoca.org/event/on-the-queer-songbook-taylor-mac-and-matt-ra
 y/
END:VEVENT
