SUMMARY:Gibney Company: Another Look
LOCATION:Mass MoCA\, 1040 Mass MoCA Way\, North Adams\, MA 01247
DESCRIPTION:Choreography by Lucinda Childs\, Composition by Philip Glass\n
 “The troupe’s superpower is clear: its strong and versatile dancers\, 
 artists who appear to be physically capable of anything.” —The New Yor
 k Times\, June 2022 Following two successful collaborations\, Gibney Compa
 ny Resident Choreographer Lucinda Childs is creating a full-length work se
 t to Another Look at Harmony\, Part 4\, a major score by Philip Glass that
  has never been choreographed at this scale. Premiering at New York City C
 enter in January 2027\, the work is conceived in celebration of Philip Gla
 ss’ 90th birthday and reunites two defining figures of American minimali
 sm in a rare and timely artistic convergence.\nhttps://massmoca.org/event/
 gibney-company-another-look-choreography-by-lucinda-childs-composition-by-
 philip-glass/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://massmoca.org/event/gibney-company-another-look-choreography-by-
 lucinda-childs-composition-by-philip-glass/
END:VEVENT
